// Contract between the Stash containers (Go, Linux) and stash-fsd, the
// Windows service that owns all access to the media library.
//
// Paths
//   All paths are Windows paths written with forward slashes, e.g.
//   "U:/Media/clip.mp4" or "//nas/share/clip.mp4". stash-fsd converts to the
//   native form at its boundary and rejects paths outside its configured
//   roots with PERMISSION_DENIED.
//
// Errors
//   NOT_FOUND          path does not exist           (Go: fs.ErrNotExist)
//   PERMISSION_DENIED  outside roots / access denied (Go: fs.ErrPermission)
//   ALREADY_EXISTS     destination exists            (Go: fs.ErrExist)
//   FAILED_PRECONDITION e.g. not a directory, directory not empty
